    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712940/extras/a7345864a284f09e3facd76aacd1ecd5.avif?t=1715095629\" width=591 height=119 /></span><br><br><strong>Photograph the animals</strong> and learn about them and their environment.<br><br>Hand-drawn animations and illustrations.<br><br>Find the right moment to take a photo of the animals you find. No rush, take this walk at your own pace.<br><br>Talk to your contacts through your mobile and thus advance the story. Make your own decisions.<br><br>This is your adventure, so you will have to respond or ignore the messages. Dedicate yourself to taking photos of the animals and enjoying the landscapes.",
